' v1.2's service leader is the selected character (`serviceLeader =
' SelectedCharacter`, `ServiceScene.cs:137, 227, 232`; `preset classic ai
' none seed 3 start 0 party`: New Sandez, the companion handed over). Two
' days for thirst. In the pub together, the knife goes onto the table from
' the leader's page and off it into the companion's (the page shown takes
' it). Single mode: the leader goes into the restaurant alone and out again,
' and stands there. The companion is selected at the pub's door and goes in:
' his page is the first (`SetGroup(SelectedCharacter)`), the leader, ninety
' off, has none. The knife from his page: he drinks, the leader does not.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
wait 60
day
day                      ' both thirsty
mapclick 309,264         ' the pub, together
wait 120
esc                      ' the film
wait 5
sceneclick 52,156        ' the knife onto the table
pack                     ' the companion's page
sceneclick 176,181       ' the knife into his pack
esc
wait 5
group                    ' single mode
mapclick 375,197         ' the restaurant, the leader alone
wait 120
esc                      ' out again: the leader stands at its door
wait 5
clickfriend 1            ' the companion selected, at the pub's door
wait 5
mapclick 309,264         ' in reach: the pub opens at once
esc                      ' the film, closed at once
wait 5
sceneclick 52,119        ' the knife from his page onto the table
deal                     ' 11: he drinks; the leader, out of range, does not
esc
wait 5
save
